TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Kveldslesing BUD1 + leggetid: kap. 1\, s. 4–28 + kap. 2\, s. 29
 –40
DESCRIPTION:Kveldslesing 19:30–20:30\, lys av 20:30. Les sidene til morge
 ndagens BUD1-økt (hopp over Assessment material – oppgavene tar du på 
 sal):\ns. 5 The users of accounting information\ns. 6 Differences between 
 management accounting and financial accounting\ns. 7 The decision-making\,
  planning and control process\ns. 11 The impact of the changing business e
 nvironment on management accounting\ns. 19 Focus on customer satisfaction 
 and new management approaches\ns. 22 Functions of management accounting\ns
 . 23 Summary of the contents of this book\ns. 26 Summary\ns. 27 Key terms 
 and concepts\ns. 30 Cost objects\ns. 31 Manufacturing\, merchandising and 
 service organizations\ns. 31 Direct and indirect costs\ns. 35 Period and p
 roduct costs\ns. 37 Cost behaviour
CATEGORIES:BUD1READ
