 c performance management:\n  s. 402 The balanced scorecard\n  s. 412 Linki
 ng performance evaluation with the balanced scorecard\n  s. 414 Benefits a
 nd limitations of the balanced scorecard approach\n  s. 420 Summary\n  s. 
 422 Key terms and concepts\n  s. 423 Assessment material\nKap. 15 Strategi
 c cost management and value creation:\n  s. 429 (kapittelstart)\n  s. 432 
 Cost management and the value chain\n  s. 435 Life cycle cost management\n
 \nPensum: kap. 1–10\, 12 og 14–16 (BUD1-plan). Alle kapitler skal vær
 e gjennomgått innen 22.11.
CATEGORIES:BUD1
